OL,3,GNEWSAHospital maternity unit reopening
OL,4,Adate delayed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reopening of a hospital's maternity
OL,7,Fservices has been delayed by health
OL,8,Fbosses.
OL,10,FBirthing services at North Devon
OL,11,FDistrict Hospital (NDDH) in Barnstaple
OL,12,Fhave been closed since 11 August due to
OL,13,Fstaffing issues, meaning pregnant women
OL,14,Fface a 53-mile (85km) trip to Exeter to
OL,15,Fgive birth.
OL,17,FThe Royal Devon University Healthcare
OL,18,FNHS Foundation Trust, which runs the
OL,19,Fhospital, had provisionally planned to
OL,20,Freopen the services on 29 September.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
